  "details": "Description\n\nHi,\n\nI don't know if it comes from my side or VRC side ;\n\nI gifted 10 vrc+ for the hype train\n\nI received the \"normal rewards\" yay me\n\nBUT, the hype train did not start, and i did not receive any of the 10vrc+ hype train reward.\n\nIt seems like i can't see any hype train at all on top of that. \n\nThanks for looking into that.\n\nReproduction Steps\n\nBuying vrchat subscriptions (at least 10)\n\nI did receive the normal rewards\n\nThe hype train did not start\n\nDid not receive any of the hype train rewards (10)\n\nDetails\n\n- Category: Other\n\n- Frequency: Always\n\n---\n\nplatform: PC (platform: Windows, store: Steam, headset: None)\n\nrawPlatform: WindowsPlayer\n\nclientVersion: 2026.4.2-1953-d52354d5be-Release\n\nunityVersion: 6000.0.67f1-DWR\n\nIn-Client Report\n\n---\n\n**Log file:** [output_log_2026-11-26_17-58-04.txt](https://api.vrchat.cloud/api/1/file/file_31d04648-cd96-49df-a205-74d41c2cd02d/1/file)",
